sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Public client
    participant E as Public edge / Apache
    participant H as Home VM boundary
    Note over C,E: Name resolution assumed
    C->>E: Attempt HTTPS over public IPv4
    Note over E: TLS termination unverified
    E->>H: Forward a matching request
    Note over E,H: Upstream transport unverified
    H-->>E: Return upstream response
    E-->>C: Return client response
